Description: AIC8800 Wi-Fi 6 USB driver for Tenda adapters (DKMS)
 Driver for USB Wi-Fi 6 adapters built on the AICSemi AIC8800 chip family,
 such as the Tenda U2 and W311MI V6 (AX300) and the U11 and U11 Pro (AX900).
 .
 This is the driver Tenda ships for Linux, patched for current kernels and
 built through DKMS so it is rebuilt on every kernel update. The package
 also ships the firmware and a udev rule that switches the adapter from its
 virtual driver disk to Wi-Fi mode.
